-sp-num">EP 03</span><span class="ct-sp-title">Turning Strategy Into Execution</span><span class="ct-sp-guest">Olatunji Obaoye</span></button><button class="ct-sp-card" data-ep="120dwtpC1phaAZMxYMhniH" data-guest="Esohe Obaseki" data-num="02" data-role="Product Marketing Manager, Sterling Bank" data-title="Marketing to the Skeptical Consumer" type="button"><span class="ct-sp-thumb"><img alt="Episode 02 cover: Esohe Obaseki" loading="lazy" src="/img/pod-ep02.webp"/><span class="ct-sp-play"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="16" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M7 4.5v15l13-7.5z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span><span class="ct-sp-num">EP 02</span><span class="ct-sp-title">Marketing to the Skeptical Consumer</span><span class="ct-sp-guest">Esohe Obaseki</span></button><button class="ct-sp-card" data-ep="3Xqy20XWMW6cNq4Oh4vRPA" data-guest="Toyosi Abolarin" data-num="01" data-role="Founder and CEO, Yolat" data-title="Building in a Trust-First Industry" type="button"><span class="ct-sp-thumb"><img alt="Episode 01 cover: Toyosi Abolarin" loading="lazy" src="/img/pod-ep01.webp"/><span class="ct-sp-play"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="16" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M7 4.5v15l13-7.5z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span><span class="ct-sp-num">EP 01</span><span class="ct-sp-title">Building in a Trust-First Industry</span><span class="ct-sp-guest">Toyosi Abolarin</span></button></div>
