</section><section class="section growth" id="podcast-steps"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="growth-wrapper"><div class="growth-top-wrap sticky"><div class="growth-left-wrap"><h2 class="growth-title">Be Our Next Guest</h2></div><div class="growth-right-wrap"><p class="growth-details">Founders can feature on the show. One conversation in your calendar, and we handle everything after it.</p><a class="primary-button w-inline-block is-green" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><div class="primary-btn-wrap"><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _01"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _02"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-bg"></div></div></a></div></div><div class="growth-wrap"><div class="growth-grid-wrap"><div class="growth-card-wrapper"><div class="growth-card-wrap"><div class="growth-card-all-wrap"><div class="growth-card-icon-wrap"><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-book.svg"/><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-book-dark.svg"/></div><div class="growth-card-title">Book your slot</div><p class="growth-card-details">Pick a time that works and tell us about your business and who you want to reach.</p></div><div class="growth-card-bg"></div></div></div><div class="growth-card-wrapper"><div class="growth-card-wrap"><div class="growth-card-all-wrap"><div class="growth-card-icon-wrap"><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-record.svg"/><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-record-dark.svg"/></div><div class="growth-card-title">Record the conversation</div><p class="growth-card-details">Sit down with Subomi for an open conversation about what you are building.</p></div><div class="growth-card-bg"></div></div></div><div class="growth-card-wrapper"><div class="growth-card-wrap"><div class="growth-card-all-wrap"><div class="growth-card-icon-wrap"><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-produce.svg"/><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-produce-dark.svg"/></div><div class="growth-card-title">Edit and produce</div><p class="growth-card-details">We edit the full episode and cut the strongest moments into short clips.</p></div><div class="growth-card-bg"></div></div></div><div class="growth-card-wrapper"><div class="growth-card-wrap"><div class="growth-card-all-wrap"><div class="growth-card-icon-wrap"><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-publish.svg"/><img alt="" class="growth-card-icon" src="/img/icons/step-publish-dark.svg"/></div><div class="growth-card-title">Publish everywhere</div><p class="growth-card-details">The episode goes out on YouTube and Spotify, with reels ready for your socials.</p></div><div class="growth-card-bg"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section plan" id="podcast-included"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="plan-wrapper"><div class="plan-top-wrap"><div class="plan-sub-title">What's Included</div><h2 class="plan-title">One Conversation, Every Format</h2><div class="plan-details">Each episode is produced and published for you, ready to share the week it goes live.</div></div><div class="plan-wrap"><div class="pricing-inner-tabs w-tabs"><div class="pricing-inner-tab-content w-tab-content"><div class="pricing-inner-tab-pane w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="pricing-tab-grid-wrap sticky ct-single"><div class="pricing-cl-wrapper sticky"><div class="pricing-cl-list" role="list"><div class="pricing-cl-item" role="listitem"><div class="pricing-tab-card-wrap center"><div class="pricing-top-wrap"><div class="pricing-icon-wrap"><img alt="" class="pricing-card-icon" src="/img/icons/offer-mic.svg"/></div></div><div class="pricing-card-title">Podcast Feature</div><p class="pricing-card-details">A recorded conversation with Subomi about your business, turned into content you can use.</p><div class="pricing-button-wrap"><a class="pricing-button current w-inline-block" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><div class="pricing-btn-text">Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="pricing-btn-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/><div class="pricing-bg current"></div></a></div><div class="feature-title">What's included</div><div class="feature-list-wrapper"><div class="feature-list-wrap"><img alt="" class="feature-list-icon" src="/img/icons/check-white.svg"/><div class="feature-list-text white">Recorded founder conversation</div></div><div class="feature-list-wrap"><img alt="" class="feature-list-icon" src="/img/icons/check-white.svg"/><div class="feature-list-text white">Full YouTube episode</div></div><div class="feature-list-wrap"><img alt="" class="feature-list-icon" src="/img/icons/check-white.svg"/><div class="feature-list-text white">Spotify audio release</div></div><div class="feature-list-wrap"><img alt="" class="feature-list-icon" src="/img/icons/check-white.svg"/><div class="feature-list-text white">Social reels from the episode</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>
</Base>
